# SuperDataLoader

## Project Overview

This is a TypeScript repo. The goal of SuperDataLoader is to make a drop-in replacement for DataLoader. DataLoader returns promises, even when the data is available. The goal of SuperDataLoader is to be faster then DataLoader, by returning
data instead of promises when possible.

